 attain hero status. 
 Along with the prestige of being a recognised 
 hero, is the ability to change their title
 at will with the |YKB'ltitle' |YKOcommand.

 In addition Heros have the option of adding
 a second guild, broadening their skills and
 overall scope. This second guild is governed 
 by a variety of restrictions which are outlined
 in the dualguilds help file.
